ds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Acid staff is a weapon that is bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Town_Shop\" title=\"Goblin Town Shop\">Goblin Town shop</a> after <a href=\"/wiki/The_Arena\" title=\"The Arena\">the Arena</a> has been defeated, it is a long wooden staff with a ball of acid at the end. when used it fires a green projectile similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious mushrooms</a> dealing moderate damage and passing through multiple enemies.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>-The acid staff serves as a weapon between the <a href=\"/wiki/Rust_Breaker\" title=\"Rust Breaker\">Rust breaker</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusted_Piercer\" title=\"Rusted Piercer\">Rusted Piercer</a> as it has an area of effect and long cooldown but is a ranged weapon and has auto aim like all other weapons in the catagory.\n</p><p>-the acid staff is wielded by the Goblin wizard an enemy rarely found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> and in the last two waves of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Arena\" title=\"The Arena\">the Arena</a> (it does not drop the weapon)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902191838\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 80/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019482/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.886      1 Template:Tool\n100.00%   40.886      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4299-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902191838 and revision id 19170. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Infobox_templates"],"links":[{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Goblin Town Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Mysterious Mushrooms","exists":true},{"title":"Rust Breaker","exists":true},{"title":"Rusted Piercer","exists":true},{"title":"The Arena","exists":true}],"images":["Goblinstaff.png"]}
